lows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-09-30-clarity-acts-failure-gave-crypto-faster-regulatory-wins-bitwise-says-417362\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Clarity Act\u2019s failure gave crypto \u2018faster\u2019 regulatory wins, Bitwise CIO says</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
